script = ExtResource("1_8jnff")
dialogue_id = "debate_communal_joy"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Communal Joy"
text = "PAGE: avatar_adult(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
avatar_adult: The two scholars speak of grand plans and historical mistakes, but I find myself drawn to something simpler.
avatar_adult: When I walk among our people, I rarely see them debating how the land should be ruled. I see them trying to stay warm.
avatar_adult: The Cloud Sea is vast.
avatar_adult: It is a terrifying thing to look out to the horizon and feel entirely alone.
avatar_adult: What do people do when they are cold and afraid?
avatar_adult: They huddle together under a warm blanket.
avatar_adult: When a village gathers to sing the same song and eat from the same pot, they are pulling that shared blanket over their shoulders.
avatar_adult: Is there a better joy than knowing that your neighbor understands your heart?
avatar_adult: If our shared faith does nothing else but keep us from feeling alone in this vast sea, then I think it is a wonderful thing."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
